{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":7,"title":"Self-knowledge and enlightenment","narrator":{"name":"Brian","voice":"en-US-BrianMultilingualNeural"},"duration":345.768,"scenes":[{"layout":"title","headline":"Self-Knowledge and Enlightenment","visual":["Knowing God fully"],"L":[],"say":"Chapter Seven. Self-Knowledge and Enlightenment. The first six chapters taught Arjuna how to act and how to sit. Now Krishna begins to teach him who God is.","start":0.0,"at":0.576,"end":11.976,"words":[[0.05,0.4,"Chapter"],[0.463,0.525,"Seven"],[1.375,0.863,"Self-Knowledge"],[2.263,0.163,"and"],[2.438,0.787,"Enlightenment"],[3.612,0.075,"The"],[3.7,0.312,"first"],[4.025,0.237,"six"],[4.275,0.537,"chapters"],[4.825,0.263,"taught"],[5.1,0.512,"Arjuna"],[5.625,0.175,"how"],[5.812,0.113,"to"],[5.938,0.425,"act"],[6.375,0.1,"and"],[6.487,0.138,"how"],[6.638,0.087,"to"],[6.737,0.45,"sit"],[7.575,0.175,"Now"],[7.763,0.45,"Krishna"],[8.225,0.463,"begins"],[8.7,0.125,"to"],[8.838,0.263,"teach"],[9.113,0.2,"him"],[9.325,0.138,"who"],[9.475,0.312,"God"],[9.8,0.362,"is"]]},{"layout":"story","headline":"Nothing more to know","visual":["Listen, and you will know Me fully","After this, nothing remains to be known","Of thousands who strive, scarcely one knows Me"],"L":["L7","L6"],"say":"Listen, Krishna says, and you will know me fully, without any doubt. I will give you knowledge together with its realisation, and after that, nothing more will remain to be known. Then he adds a sober note. Out of thousands of people, scarcely one strives for perfection. And of those who succeed, scarcely one truly knows me.","start":11.976,"at":12.552,"end":33.936,"words":[[0.087,0.463,"Listen"],[0.575,0.412,"Krishna"],[1.0,0.512,"says"],[1.75,0.188,"and"],[1.95,0.138,"you"],[2.1,0.125,"will"],[2.237,0.175,"know"],[2.425,0.15,"me"],[2.587,0.512,"fully"],[3.125,0.425,"without"],[3.562,0.2,"any"],[3.775,0.45,"doubt"],[4.625,0.113,"I"],[4.75,0.15,"will"],[4.912,0.163,"give"],[5.088,0.113,"you"],[5.213,0.463,"knowledge"],[5.688,0.45,"together"],[6.15,0.15,"with"],[6.312,0.163,"its"],[6.487,0.812,"realisation"],[7.612,0.225,"and"],[7.85,0.325,"after"],[8.188,0.35,"that"],[8.562,0.388,"nothing"],[8.963,0.338,"more"],[9.312,0.188,"will"],[9.512,0.375,"remain"],[9.9,0.113,"to"],[10.025,0.113,"be"],[10.15,0.425,"known"],[10.95,0.138,"Then"],[11.1,0.212,"he"],[11.325,0.287,"adds"],[11.625,0.062,"a"],[11.7,0.362,"sober"],[12.075,0.412,"note"],[12.887,0.113,"Out"],[13.012,0.113,"of"],[13.137,0.525,"thousands"],[13.675,0.1,"of"],[13.787,0.45,"people"],[14.25,0.613,"scarcely"],[14.875,0.275,"one"],[15.162,0.562,"strives"],[15.738,0.175,"for"],[15.925,0.662,"perfection"],[16.988,0.113,"And"],[17.113,0.113,"of"],[17.238,0.263,"those"],[17.512,0.125,"who"],[17.65,0.625,"succeed"],[18.288,0.6,"scarcely"],[18.9,0.263,"one"],[19.175,0.362,"truly"],[19.55,0.325,"knows"],[19.887,0.263,"me"]]},{"layout":"steps","headline":"God's lower nature: eight parts","visual":["Earth and water","Fire and air","Ether","Mind and intellect","Ego"],"L":["L2"],"say":"First, Krishna says, I have two natures, a lower one and a higher one. The lower nature is matter, in eight parts: earth, water, fire, air and ether, and then mind, intellect and ego. Even our thoughts belong to this material side. Above it is God's higher nature, the living Spirit, which sustains the whole universe.","start":33.936,"at":34.512,"end":56.76,"words":[[0.087,0.425,"First"],[0.537,0.425,"Krishna"],[0.975,0.388,"says"],[1.375,0.113,"I"],[1.5,0.175,"have"],[1.688,0.175,"two"],[1.875,0.562,"natures"],[2.45,0.113,"a"],[2.575,0.338,"lower"],[2.925,0.3,"one"],[3.237,0.113,"and"],[3.362,0.05,"a"],[3.425,0.35,"higher"],[3.788,0.312,"one"],[4.487,0.087,"The"],[4.588,0.25,"lower"],[4.85,0.312,"nature"],[5.175,0.113,"is"],[5.3,0.425,"matter"],[5.737,0.15,"in"],[5.9,0.163,"eight"],[6.075,0.487,"parts"],[6.963,0.388,"earth"],[7.375,0.475,"water"],[7.862,0.575,"fire"],[8.662,0.275,"air"],[8.95,0.113,"and"],[9.075,0.475,"ether"],[9.9,0.15,"and"],[10.062,0.15,"then"]