ries you across"],"L":["L3"],"say":"Lesson three. Maya, the divine illusion, is extremely difficult to overcome. It is made of the three forces of nature, and it deludes almost all of us. Krishna is clear: willpower and intellect alone won't get you across. Those who surrender to him cross it easily.","start":221.76,"at":222.336,"end":241.8,"words":[[0.062,0.362,"Lesson"],[0.438,0.45,"three"],[1.288,0.55,"Maya"],[1.863,0.15,"the"],[2.025,0.4,"divine"],[2.438,0.662,"illusion"],[3.362,0.2,"is"],[3.575,0.65,"extremely"],[4.237,0.487,"difficult"],[4.737,0.087,"to"],[4.838,0.662,"overcome"],[5.912,0.1,"It"],[6.025,0.138,"is"],[6.175,0.325,"made"],[6.513,0.113,"of"],[6.638,0.1,"the"],[6.75,0.3,"three"],[7.062,0.45,"forces"],[7.525,0.113,"of"],[7.65,0.562,"nature"],[8.512,0.2,"and"],[8.725,0.125,"it"],[8.863,0.512,"deludes"],[9.387,0.4,"almost"],[9.8,0.25,"all"],[10.062,0.113,"of"],[10.188,0.35,"us"],[10.925,0.35,"Krishna"],[11.287,0.138,"is"],[11.438,0.525,"clear"],[12.438,0.775,"willpower"],[13.225,0.1,"and"],[13.338,0.45,"intellect"],[13.8,0.425,"alone"],[14.238,0.237,"won't"],[14.488,0.175,"get"],[14.675,0.125,"you"],[14.812,0.588,"across"],[15.8,0.25,"Those"],[16.062,0.163,"who"],[16.238,0.537,"surrender"],[16.788,0.125,"to"],[16.925,0.25,"him"],[17.188,0.362,"cross"],[17.562,0.113,"it"],[17.688,0.55,"easily"]]},{"layout":"lesson","headline":"Four Types of People Seek God","visual":["The distressed, the curious, the seeker of wealth","And the wise","All are noble; the wise are dearest"],"L":["L4"],"say":"Lesson four. Four types of people seek God: the person in distress, the seeker of knowledge, the seeker of wealth, and the wise one who has already tasted the Supreme. Krishna calls them all noble. But the wise devotee, whose love asks for nothing, is like his own Self.","start":241.8,"at":242.376,"end":261.12,"words":[[0.062,0.325,"Lesson"],[0.4,0.438,"four"],[1.238,0.138,"Four"],[1.387,0.338,"types"],[1.738,0.087,"of"],[1.837,0.275,"people"],[2.125,0.3,"seek"],[2.43